- Add 1 to second 0: [0, 1, 2] -> product 0.
- Add 1 to 2: [0, 0, 3] -> product 0.
So if there are multiple zeros, the max product is 0.
If there is exactly one zero, say [0, 2, 3].
- Add 1 to 0: [1, 2, 3] -> product 6.
